# 🟢 5. Service & Version Detection

| Command                                    | Explanation                            |
| ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |
| `sudo nmap -sV <TARGET>`                   | 🟢 Detect services and versions        |
| `sudo nmap -sV -p80 <TARGET>`              | 🟢 Version detection on port 80        |
| `sudo nmap -sC -sV <TARGET>`               | 🟢 Default NSE + version detection     |
| `sudo nmap --version-intensity 5 <TARGET>` | 🟡 Control version detection intensity |
| `sudo nmap -A <TARGET>`                    | 🟢 Aggressive enumeration              |

### ⭐ Standard Enumeration

```bash
sudo nmap -sC -sV -p<OPEN_PORTS> <TARGET>
```

Example:

```bash
sudo nmap -sC -sV -p22,80,443 10.10.10.10
```

