# 🟡 11. Timing

| Option | Timing        | Use               |
| ------ | ------------- | ----------------- |
| `-T0`  | 🔴 Paranoid   | Extremely slow    |
| `-T1`  | 🟠 Sneaky     | Slow              |
| `-T2`  | 🟡 Polite     | Slow              |
| `-T3`  | 🟢 Normal     | Default           |
| `-T4`  | 🔵 Aggressive | Common HTB choice |
| `-T5`  | 🔴 Insane     | Very aggressive   |

### Common HTB Scan

```bash
sudo nmap -sS -p- -T4 <TARGET>
```

Faster:

```bash
sudo nmap -sS -p- -T4 --min-rate 1000 <TARGET>
```

