# ⚫ 17. Saving Results

### Normal

```bash
sudo nmap -oN scan.nmap <TARGET>
```

⚫ Human-readable output.

### Grepable

```bash
sudo nmap -oG scan.gnmap <TARGET>
```

⚫ Grep-friendly format.

### XML

```bash
sudo nmap -oX scan.xml <TARGET>
```

⚫ XML format.

### All Formats

```bash
sudo nmap -oA scan <TARGET>
```

Creates:

```text
scan.nmap
scan.gnmap
scan.xml
```

