# 🔥 21. CPTS Nmap Methodology

```text
                  🎯 TARGET
                     │
                     ▼
             🟢 HOST DISCOVERY
                  -sn / -Pn
                     │
                     ▼
             🔵 FULL TCP SCAN
                    -sS -p-
                     │
                     ▼
             🟢 SERVICE ENUM
                    -sC -sV
                     │
                     ▼
             🟣 NSE ENUMERATION
                  --script
                     │
                     ▼
             🔵 UDP ENUMERATION
                     -sU
                     │
                     ▼
              🔴 FILTERED?
                     │
                     ▼
           🟡 FIREWALL ANALYSIS
                     │
                     ▼
             🔴 EVASION TESTING
          ACK / Fragment / Source Port
                     │
                     ▼
             🟢 RE-ENUMERATE
                     │
                     ▼
                 💥 EXPLOIT
```

