# 🚨 24. Golden Rules

```text
🟢 1. OPEN ≠ Vulnerable

⚫ 2. CLOSED ≠ Host is down

🔴 3. FILTERED ≠ Port is closed

🟡 4. SERVICE name ≠ Confirmed application

🟢 5. VERSION information is valuable

🟡 6. OS detection is an estimate

🔎 7. Always investigate unusual ports

🔵 8. UDP commonly produces open|filtered

🧠 9. Use --reason when confused

🔄 10. Re-enumerate after discovering something interesting
```

